Attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

atomic-cc is an INDEPENDENT port of concepts, contracts, and reducer rules from
Atomic by Bastani:

    https://github.com/bastani-inc/atomic   (MIT License)
    https://docs.bastani.ai

It bundles NO Atomic code. The convergence rules implemented here were
re-derived from the published upstream sources — `review-convergence.ts`,
`goal-reducer.ts`, `ralph-review-gate.ts`, `goal-schemas.ts`,
`adversarial-verification-runner.ts` — and from the official documentation, then
rewritten from scratch against Claude Code's own plugin primitives (dynamic
workflows, subagents, skills, hooks).

Full credit for the underlying design — the stop_review_loop approval contract,
the quorum reducer, the finding-blocking classification, the blocker-threshold
anti-loop, the pass/fail adversarial verifier with a fresh-context reducer — goes
to the Atomic project and its authors.

